# Add project specific R8 rules here.
# AGP will combine all keep rule files in src/main/keepRules to pass to R8
#
# For more details, see
#   https://d.android.com/r/tools/r8/keep-rules

# Glance identifies a widget by its class name. R8 class merging collapsed
# ScreenTimeWidget and ReelCountWidget into one class, so an update of either
# painted both home-screen widgets.
-keep class me.ankitgrai.kaizen.widget.ScreenTimeWidget
-keep class me.ankitgrai.kaizen.widget.ReelCountWidget
-keep class me.ankitgrai.kaizen.widget.ScreenTimeWidgetReceiver
-keep class me.ankitgrai.kaizen.widget.ReelCountWidgetReceiver
